      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Major Rock Edict XIII contains the vivid description of the Kalinga War and Ashoka's remorse.",
        "James Prinsep deciphered Brahmi and Kharosthi scripts in 1837; this is a frequently asked preliminary exam question.",
        "Megasthenes categorized Mauryan society into 7 functional classes rather than the traditional four Varnas.",
        "The Lion Capital of Sarnath, which serves as the National Emblem of India, was erected during Ashoka's reign."
